    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35612" root="قسب" body-key="q">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَسِيبٌ</span></b>  <i>A current,</i> or <i>flow,</i> of water: (ISk, S,
O:) or its <i>current,</i> or <i>flow, with a sound:</i> (K:)
or its <i>current,</i> or <i>flow, beneath trees:</i> (A, TA:)
or its <i>sound beneath leaves</i> (T, A) or <i>rubbish.</i> (T,
TA.) ＝   
